{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】政府表示關注港島綫香港大學站接連出現同類信號設備部件問題，影響列車服務。</p>\n<p>機電工程署已派員到場調查，初步顯示不涉及鐵路安全事宜。政府已要求港鐵深入調查事故原因，全面報告跟進工作和改善措施，防止同類情況再次發生。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.575101+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:20:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:13.027147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:13.027147+00:00","content_hash":"8f269505e83b67884eba002821abcc5a257552e97f3449a66a3a11ea984a723e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}